00:12:30.760 --> 00:12:31.580
We were like, why are we doing this?

269
00:12:31.640 --> 00:12:36.920
I was going to say though, both our shows have really iconic grab you by the lapels kind

270
00:12:36.920 --> 00:12:37.820
of theme songs.

271
00:12:38.220 --> 00:12:38.340
Yeah.

272
00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:41.960
And there's something especially about if you do the first season, people get to know

273
00:12:41.960 --> 00:12:42.600
the theme song.

274
00:12:42.700 --> 00:12:47.600
By the second season, it's actually really thrilling to do a cold open and then cut, you know,

275
00:12:47.600 --> 00:12:49.220
do the needle drop to the theme song.

276
00:12:49.480 --> 00:12:49.800
Yeah.

277
00:12:49.880 --> 00:12:53.320
I feel like our theme songs were almost the button at the end of the scene sometimes,

278
00:12:53.680 --> 00:12:53.860
right?

279
00:12:54.280 --> 00:12:54.660
Yeah.

280
00:12:55.160 --> 00:12:59.200
You know, Craig, we did usually have a cold open every once in a while.

